<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel 1996 EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel 1996 EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rodman &amp; Renshaw analyst Vincent Glinski said he boosted his 1996 earnings per share estimate for Intel Corp to $5.45 from $4.95. The company had 1995 earnings per share of $4.03.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the semiconductors giant were up 3-3/8 to 111.</p>
<p>-- He said he made the move on the strength of Intel's strong third-quarter results.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
